            "review_title": "Review at Ringo Sushi Omakase (j-style)",
            "review_text": "Lee Eun Be\nHanoi, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nRecommend omakase taste\nDec 2024 • Family\nWhat a fantastic anniversary surprise. Ringo went above and beyond to make our evening special. Omakase menu was a delightful surprise, an adorable cake for our anniversary 😊The res space was quite small and simple but i can see that they focus on dishes.Seasonal ingredients, excactly Japanese taste like i enjoyed inJapan before. Not twinkling as other morden omakase restaurants but i love simplicity with authentic janpanes flavour👍\nRead more\nWritten January 13, 2025",
