            "review_title": "Review at Ringo Sushi Omakase (j-style)",
            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n2\nBeautifully presented and tasty food\nNov 2024 • Couples\nThis is such a lovely authentic feel Japanese restaurant. I have been twice now, once for work and enjoyed sitting at the counter watching the food being created and the second more recent in the dining area.\nThe set menus vary in course sizes, we enjoyed as a couple the kumo 9 course this month with a bottle of sake to share, each course was beautifully presented and explained and tasted great. Our favourite course was the sashimi.\nStaff are very friendly and welcoming.\nRead more\nWritten December 1, 2024\nCulture47658638930\nThank you so much for your kind words and for taking the time to share your experience! We’re delighted to know you enjoyed your visit and look forward to welcoming you back soon😊\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
